<title>USA: Shop At Home gets FCC okay on station buy [CORRECTED 18:10 GMT].</title>
<headline>Shop At Home gets FCC okay on station buy [CORRECTED 18:10 GMT].</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shop At Home Inc said on Thursday the U.S. Federal Communications Commission has approved its application to acquire the 51 percent of KZJL, Channel 61 in Houston, that it does not already own.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close in early September, Shop At Home said.</p>
<p>(Corrects month deal is expected to close from November).</p>
</text>
